    {
      "id": "Wnh-JWG-ReKi0mzn1f3FS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6218.995852041156,
      "y": 10583.250806143213,
      "width": 926.7998657226562,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 909300509,
      "version": 419,
      "versionNonce": 1267097181,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768045504550,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "规则1 符合“知名电商平台” True:SYSTEM PASS, False:SYSTEM Reject\n规则2 小额免审入账 True:SYSTEM PASS, Fasles:SKIP",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "规则1 符合“知名电商平台” True:SYSTEM PASS, False:SYSTEM Reject\n规则2 小额免审入账 True:SYSTEM PASS, Fasles:SKIP",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fiUduQpz40TJpy70F_02T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6260.990618167146,
      "y": 10705.48820308238,
      "width": 517.9999389648438,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1657409427,
      "version": 396,
      "versionNonce": 248455133,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768045869574,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "规则NO1 符合“知名电商平台”\n    付款人名称 == [知名电商平台]词库\nand 渠道 != Pingpong\n\n规则NO2 小额免审入账\n    商户VA过去24小时入账金额 < 1USD",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "规则NO1 符合“知名电商平台”\n    付款人名称 == [知名电商平台]词库\nand 渠道 != Pingpong\n\n规则NO2 小额免审入账\n    商户VA过去24小时入账金额 < 1USD",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ff-lD3hWJA60cv072LYYt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9528.990815677926,
      "y": 7584.4249805841955,
      "width": 1045.7998046875,
      "height": 900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1711110909,
      "version": 1324,
      "versionNonce": 1693647571,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768290216710,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1、“平台白名单”免审规则\n\n付款人名称 == [白名单平台词库]\n\n2、小额入账规则\n\n过去24小时该VA 非人工审核通过的 折美元金额 <= 1USD\nand 该笔B2C收款 折美元金额 <= 1USD\n\n3、“商户白名单”免审规则\n\n收款账号（商户VA）== [白名单商户VA词库]\nand 付款银行账号 == [白名单付款银行账号词库]\nor\n收款账号（商户VA）== [白名单商户VA词库]\nand 计算匹配度(付款银行账号、白名单付款银行账号词库)>0.95\n\n4、“新买家”拒绝规则\n\n(全部时间范围内)当前汇款人给该商户的成功交易笔数 = 0",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1、“平台白名单”免审规则\n\n付款人名称 == [白名单平台词库]\n\n2、小额入账规则\n\n过去24小时该VA 非人工审核通过的 折美元金额 <= 1USD\nand 该笔B2C收款 折美元金额 <= 1USD\n\n3、“商户白名单”免审规则\n\n收款账号（商户VA）== [白名单商户VA词库]\nand 付款银行账号 == [白名单付款银行账号词库]\nor\n收款账号（商户VA）== [白名单商户VA词库]\nand 计算匹配度(付款银行账号、白名单付款银行账号词库)>0.95\n\n4、“新买家”拒绝规则\n\n(全部时间范围内)当前汇款人给该商户的成功交易笔数 = 0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
